leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the update installed when the Iron Knuckle is beaten: once the player leaves cutscene mode it restores the normal update and draw, starts the Nabooru defeat cutscene, sets the battle-finished flag and enters cutscene action 3.
